WEBVTT

00:00:00.611 --> 00:00:01.857
<v><b>A:</b></v> What time is it?

00:00:02.278 --> 00:00:04.102
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s half past two.

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:07.868
<v><b>A:</b></v> Is the meeting on Wednesday?

00:00:08.352 --> 00:00:09.309
<v><b>B:</b></v> I don’t know.

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:14.683
<v><b>A:</b></v> Listen and write five sentences.

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:17.974
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh no! I’m tired.